WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.663 --> 00:00:03.434
(softly ringing bells)

00:00:10.191 --> 00:00:13.030
(ominous music playing)

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:17.907
- "Dear Miss Kelsey,
we regret to inform you

00:00:17.907 --> 00:00:19.021
"that you have not been accepted

00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:21.031
"at Hogwarts due to your GPA."

00:00:22.781 --> 00:00:24.941
(loud cut-off cursing)

00:00:31.099 --> 00:00:34.004
- [Voiceover] Hogwarts is
nothing like the books.

00:00:34.004 --> 00:00:36.651
Sure, you have your houses,

00:00:36.651 --> 00:00:40.203
your athletic jocks in Gryffindor,

00:00:40.203 --> 00:00:43.263
your jaded wannabe Slytherins,

00:00:43.263 --> 00:00:46.919
your hipster nerds in Ravenclaw,

00:00:46.919 --> 00:00:50.151
and your happy Hufflepuffs.

00:00:50.151 --> 00:00:52.984
But that's about where
the similarities end.

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:55.438
(coughing)

00:00:55.438 --> 00:00:57.322
- What the hell are you doing in there?

00:00:57.322 --> 00:00:59.602
- Just studying some herbology.

00:00:59.602 --> 00:01:01.264
- Dude, those are recreational spells.

00:01:01.264 --> 00:01:02.952
In the godamn room?

00:01:05.652 --> 00:01:06.982
(door shuts)

00:01:08.182 --> 00:01:10.663
- [Voiceover] The
Gryffindors hated losing.

00:01:11.763 --> 00:01:15.099
Almost as much as the
Slytherins loved cheating.

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:17.743
- Wait a minute!

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:19.803
You took a failus felixius potion!

00:01:19.803 --> 00:01:21.348
- [Voiceover] It wasn't a Hogwarts party

00:01:21.348 --> 00:01:23.563
without an old fashioned duel.

00:01:23.563 --> 00:01:28.180
(dramatic music playing)

00:01:32.341 --> 00:01:33.568
- Cops!
(screeching record)

00:01:33.568 --> 00:01:35.594
(ominous music playing)

00:01:37.444 --> 00:01:39.789
- [Voiceover] And Dementors
could suck the soul

00:01:39.789 --> 00:01:41.880
out of a party in seconds.

00:01:43.768 --> 00:01:45.540
So there you have it.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.212
Hogwarts isn't what you expected.

00:01:48.212 --> 00:01:51.839
But, at least it's full of
the brightest students around.

00:01:51.839 --> 00:01:53.394
- Will. Whoa, wait, buddy.

00:01:53.394 --> 00:01:54.849
Where you going? Where you going?

00:01:54.849 --> 00:01:56.851
- I'm flying home. Broomin' home.

00:01:56.851 --> 00:01:59.021
- You can't fly home, I saw you shuck

00:01:59.021 --> 00:02:01.583
like five butterbeers, man.

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:02.518
C'mon...

00:02:02.518 --> 00:02:04.757
- What are you, what're
you like Dumbledore?

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.860
I'm flying outta here, man.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.289
- No dude, just stay.

00:02:08.289 --> 00:02:09.618
- I'm gonna...
- Just stay.

00:02:09.618 --> 00:02:12.010
- I'm going hooome
- No, no! No!

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.178
Oh!

00:02:13.778 --> 00:02:16.687
Will. Will, get up man.

00:02:16.687 --> 00:02:18.157
C'mon buddy.

00:02:18.157 --> 00:02:20.891
Just, c'mon. Wake up.

